WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:06.218
In the UK, 95% of undergraduates already use AI in their studies.

2
00:00:06.468 --> 00:00:12.755
So the question is no longer whether they use it. It's whether they learn to think with it.

3
00:00:13.005 --> 00:00:15.860
Every word they write, attributed.

4
00:00:16.110 --> 00:00:19.015
Every AI suggestion, declared.

5
00:00:19.265 --> 00:00:23.040
Every step, visible to them and to you.

6
00:00:23.290 --> 00:00:31.970
Thesisfic. Teach your students how to use AI: properly, ethically, responsibly.

